        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: NASA Astronaut Group 15\n- Products: Pretty Woman\n- People: Julia Roberts, Garry Marshall, J. F. Lawton\n- Concepts: The Flying Escargot\n\nFacts:\n- Pretty Woman is a 1990 American romantic comedy film directed by Garry Marshall from a screenplay by J. F. Lawton.\n- Julia Roberts became a Hollywood star after headlining Pretty Woman in 1990.\n- Pretty Woman grossed US$464 million worldwide.\n- NASA Astronaut Group 15 adopted “The Flying Escargot” as its moniker.\n- The NASA Astronaut Group 15 moniker “The Flying Escargot” may refer to two members of the group being from France or to the “flying escargot” scene in Pretty Woman.",
